      "name": "Headless",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "An argyrzei is headless but can still hear, speak, see, and smell as if it had a head. The argyrzei is immune to decapitation effects, such as those caused by vorpal weapons."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Soul Shred",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Creatures killed by an argyrzei are difficult to bring back to life or animate as undead. The argyrzei automatically attempts to counteract|CRB|3|counteracting|0 any attempt to resurrect or animate any creature that it has killed (counteract modifier +23, counteract level 7th). If the argyrzei who slew the creature is itself slain, the creature can be brought back from death or become undead normally."
      ]
    },
