      "entries": [
        "The argyrzei concentrates on an adjacent silver object that's no larger than Bulk 2. That object becomes infected silver|SoG4|cursed; if the object is being carried, the object's carrier can resist the object becoming cursed with a DC 33 Will save. The argyrzei can maintain up to five curses simultaneously; if it infects a sixth silver item, the oldest cursed item becomes uncursed."
      ],
